      "title": "09 | NATIVE Qwen: precleaned crop + SAM guide",
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "TextEncodeQwenImage21"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Edit <image1>. The solid white shapes in <image1> temporarily cover an unwanted printed overlay / watermark; they are NOT part of the real scene. <image2> is a black-and-white LOCATION MASK, not a photo: WHITE indicates the exact spots to reconstruct, BLACK indicates background to keep. Replace every white covered area in <image1> with a natural continuation of the underlying photograph based on its visible surroundings. Reconstruct matching subjects, textures, perspective, lighting, shadows and colors. Remove all watermark lettering, logos, white shapes, and visible traces. Preserve everything else unchanged. Output a normal realistic photograph without text overlays, watermarks, logos, paint marks, or blurry patches.",
        "",
        0
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "prompt": "Edit <image1>. The solid white shapes in <image1> temporarily cover an unwanted printed overlay / watermark; they are NOT part of the real scene. <image2> is a black-and-white LOCATION MASK, not a photo: WHITE indicates the exact spots to reconstruct, BLACK indicates background to keep. Replace every white covered area in <image1> with a natural continuation of the underlying photograph based on its visible surroundings. Reconstruct matching subjects, textures, perspective, lighting, shadows and colors. Remove all watermark lettering, logos, white shapes, and visible traces. Preserve everything else unchanged. Output a normal realistic photograph without text overlays, watermarks, logos, paint marks, or blurry patches.",
